---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo worker once])

    Loader[Build evaluator loader]
    Consume{Worker message available?}
    Payload{Chunk-ready payload valid?}
    Claim{Chunk claimable?}
    Context[Load run context]
    Warm[Warm evaluator components]
    Cases[Load chunk case batch]
    Permit[Acquire Wasm evaluation permits]
    Execute[Execute case evaluations in sandboxed stores]
    Persist[Persist terminal transitions]
    Complete[Mark chunk completed]
    Ack[Acknowledge message]
    Release[Release chunk lease]
    Released{Chunk released?}
    Requeue[Nack and requeue message]

    Success([Success response])

    ServiceFail([Worker error])

    Start --> Loader
    Loader --> Consume

    Consume -- No --> Success
    Consume -- Yes --> Payload
    Consume -. Consume fails .-> ServiceFail

    Payload -- No --> Ack
    Payload -- Yes --> Claim

    Claim -- No --> Ack
    Claim -- Yes --> Context
    Claim -. Claim fails .-> ServiceFail

    Context --> Warm
    Context -. Context load fails .-> ServiceFail

    Warm --> Cases
    Warm -. Warmup fails .-> Release

    Cases --> Permit
    Cases -. Load fails .-> Release

    Permit --> Execute
    Permit -. Permit acquisition fails .-> Release

    Execute --> Persist
    Execute -. Processing fails .-> Release

    Persist --> Complete
    Persist -. Persistence fails .-> Release

    Complete --> Ack
    Complete -. Completion fails .-> ServiceFail

    Ack --> Success
    Ack -. Ack fails .-> ServiceFail

    Release --> Released
    Release -. Release fails .-> ServiceFail

    Released -- Yes --> Requeue
    Released -- No --> Ack

    Requeue --> Success
    Requeue -. Requeue fails .-> ServiceFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Loader,Consume,Payload,Claim,Context,Cases,Persist,Complete,Ack,Release,Released,Requeue system
    class Warm,Permit,Execute component
    class ServiceFail error
